    <div style="margin:0 0 8px;color:#625d56;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45;">Serpentine South · London, United Kingdom</div>
    <div style="margin:0 0 9px;color:#8b3d2e;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;">2026-06-06 – 2026-10-25</div>
    <p style="margin:0;color:#292724;font-size:15px;line-height:1.62;">LANZA atelier turns a curving brick wall into a permeable garden room. It is a strong art-and-architecture stop, especially paired with the Soto installation nearby.</p>
    <p style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:13px;"><a href="https://www.serpentinegalleries.org/whats-on/serpentine-pavilion-2026-by-isabel-abascal-and-alessandro-arienzo-lanza-atelier/" style="color:#6d3d2d;">Official exhibition page →</a></p>
